# Idle check scene: the app with everything it can show so far, then no `quit`, so it
# goes idle. The screenshot at the end is the harness's "ready" signal.
# A model with a selection, a primitive preview waiting for Return, a reference image,
# the scale figure and the reference images window.
prim box
key Return
prim rock
primset centre 0 -90 20
ref Front @/../data/ref_front.png 120
action view.figure
action view.refimages
grid 4
key Shift+W
viewdir 1 Back
viewdir 2 Left
camera 3 60 30 300 10 20 0
key 1
action help.controls
action view.paintwindow
wait 4
expect paintwindow 1
expect grid 4
expect snap 0
expect controls 1
wait 3
shot idle-ready.png
